          "id": "fec9ca5b-fb64-47b1-b2a9-57e3d086cd35",
          "name": "SendGrid content and message data for the combined multi-coverage\nmanual application underwriter email.",
          "request": {
            "name": "SendGrid content and message data for the combined multi-coverage\nmanual application underwriter email.",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns the template's latest active version (HTML and subject template)\ntogether with the same ``message_data`` and ``subject`` the combined\nunderwriter email is built from, so the frontend can render the exact\nemail locally.\n\nQuery params:\n- ``application_id``: application UUID (required). The message data is\n  built directly from the application's coverage applications (ordered\n  by creation), so it works before any quotes exist.\n\nThe AI fields (``narrative``, ``description_of_operations``) are\ngenerated the same way the send flow does, so responses take a few\nseconds; either key is omitted when generation fails.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
